&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner closely with Account Executives across the region in a co-selling model, bringing deep Issuing and Treasury expertise to shared customer opportunities. Together, you’ll identify customer needs, build account strategies, and lead deals from discovery through commercial negotiations and close, with clear ownership and a coordinated customer experience.You’ll also be expected to collaborate with Product, Engineering, Marketing, and other go-to-market teams to develop deep product and industry knowledge, lead complex deals, and shape our regional go-to-market strategy. You’ll lead in-depth product discussions with business and technical stakeholders, including Mandarin-speaking customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re an experienced sales professional who can build value in competitive situations and explain complex products clearly. You’re equally comfortable working with customers and internal stakeholders, excited to become a product expert, and willing to share what you learn. You’re organised, analytical, and proactive, with a track record of improving the processes and teams around you.&lt;/p&gt;
