&lt;p&gt;As a Billing Account Executive at Stripe, you&#39;ll use your sales and product expertise to help drive growth through new and existing Stripe customers. You&#39;ll collaborate with the core sales, marketing, product marketing, and product teams to develop deep product and industry knowledge and drive strategic deals. You&#39;ll lead in-depth product discussions with existing and prospective customers and build and execute against our go-to-market strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
