&lt;li&gt;A self-starting, highly organized approach and the ability to deliver results in an ambiguous, fast-moving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written, verbal, presentation, and analytical skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel approximately 10% of the time for user meetings, team events, sales kickoffs, and occasional international business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in payments, Buy Now Pay Later, alternative payment methods, ecommerce, or financial technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the APAC payments landscape, particularly Australia and other priority markets in the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a product-sales overlay model alongside account executives, customer success teams, or technical sellers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing strategic partner relationships or three-party sales motions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with product-led integrations and the commercial and technical considerations involved in launching a new payment method.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
