&lt;p&gt;Stripe is expanding its Global Product Sales team to accelerate the adoption of Adaptive Pricing and Managed Payments across ANZ.&amp;nbsp;Adaptive Pricing helps businesses optimise local currency presentment and pricing as they expand internationally. Stripe Managed Payments, Stripe’s Merchant of Record solution, enables businesses to sell digital products globally while Stripe manages complexities including global tax, fraud prevention, dispute management, and transaction-related customer support. Stripe’s Product Sales team is at the forefront of driving revenue and growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Product Sales combines deep product knowledge, sales expertise, and a user-first approach to drive growth. The team also brings customer feedback and market insight into Stripe’s product roadmap and go-to-market strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
