&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of customer-facing sales experience at a leading technology, financial infrastructure, fintech, or payments company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with issuing or treasury focused products is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of meeting or exceeding quota in a complex B2B sales environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience growing existing customer relationships through cross-sell, upsell, product adoption, or account expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead complex, multi-stakeholder opportunities involving executives, Product, Engineering, Finance, Legal, Procurement, and other teams&lt;/li&gt;
