&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 3 years of sales or prospecting experience, ideally within a technology company, with a consistent record of top performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage a named account list and develop account plans for upper middle market and enterprise companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and maintaining relationships with C-level executives (CTO, COO, CFO).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to own and close a full sales cycle, from prospecting through to contract.&lt;/li&gt;
