&lt;li&gt;Experience managing headcount and operating expenses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting Go-to-Market, Money Management, and Corporate Finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oracle, Anaplan, Tableau, or other equivalent application experience&lt;/li&gt;
