&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong management skills for planning and executing complex cross-functional projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience, with 3-5 years of people management experience, in Business Analytics, Business Operations, Finance &amp;amp; Strategy, Technical Account Management or Payment Strategy at a leading technology or payments company, or top Management Consulting firm&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
