&lt;li&gt;Inspire, motivate, and enable individual development, creating clear expectations and meaningful career growth opportunities for direct reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead with clarity and context, communicating a compelling plan that is aligned with Stripe’s strategy and the broader Global Fraud &amp;amp; Risk organization.&lt;/li&gt;
