&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of work experience in sales/business operations, data science, investment banking, management consulting, or business analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and a structured approach to solving unique business problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with large data sets, especially in analyzing large imperfect data sets to solve problems and creating scalable reports and dashboards or ad-hoc analysis&lt;/li&gt;
