&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of full-cycle recruiting experience (in-house experience strongly preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record in target achievements, experience managing high volume hiring in fast moving environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with senior executives throughout the recruiting process, acting as an effective hiring partner and trusted advisor&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High agency, can handle ambiguity in a fast-moving organization, and thrives on a high level of autonomy and responsibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven abilities to attract passive candidates and build a diverse pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong in data driven approach to problem solving; you enjoy making sense of the trends and using the insights to improve recruiting strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills with the ability to influence stakeholders internally and externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with India market hiring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with reporting work, proficient in data tools such as Visier, Greenhouse Reports, GoodTime, Gem etc&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly adopt new recruiting technologies, AI and optimize workflows for scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
