&lt;h2&gt;About Privy&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to make privacy and user ownership the default online. To do so, we build simple, flexible APIs and tools for developers that make it easy to build new products on crypto rails.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Privy owns the abstractions and infrastructure layer above wallets, integrating across chains, third-party providers, and Stripe products like Treasury and Link. We get to solve hard technical problems while leveraging Stripe&#39;s distribution to reach customers like Ramp, Klarna, Deel, Kraken, Hyperliquid, and Fomo — powering experiences for both mainstream users and crypto natives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more about Privy: &lt;a href=&quot;https://privy.io/blog/announcing-our-acquisition-by-stripe&quot;&gt;Privy and Stripe: Bringing crypto to everyone&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an exceptional social and content marketer to help shape how some of the most important products in crypto show up on the internet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid role: part social lead, part writer and editor, part content strategist. You’ll own how Privy, Bridge, and Stripe Crypto show up across social, primarily on X and LinkedIn, while developing content that extends beyond the feed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll turn product launches, customer stories, technical concepts, and industry conversations into sharp, compelling content across short- and long-form formats. You’ll work closely with the Head of Marketing and broader marketing team to find the stories worth telling, partnering with Product, Engineering, and other teams to bring them to life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-ownership role for someone with exceptional writing instincts, strong editorial judgment, and a deep understanding of how great technology brands show up online.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own social across Privy, Bridge, and Stripe Crypto,&lt;/strong&gt; from editorial planning and drafting through publishing and engagement, primarily across X and LinkedIn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn complex products and technical concepts into sharp, accessible stories, &lt;/strong&gt;partnering across Marketing, Product, and Engineering to understand what we’re building and why it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop content across short- and long-form formats, &lt;/strong&gt;from social posts and threads to blog posts, explainers, customer stories, and event coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and evolve distinct voices across brands and channels, &lt;/strong&gt;ensuring our content is clear, confident, technically credible, and native to each platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay close to crypto, fintech, and developer communities, &lt;/strong&gt;identifying conversations, emerging narratives, and cultural moments where we have something meaningful to contribute.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring a social-first lens to launches and campaigns, &lt;/strong&gt;helping shape the story, format, and creative approach from the beginning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experiment with new formats, &lt;/strong&gt;including short-form video, product demos, graphics, and other platform-native content, creating scrappily or working with creative partners when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Surface community insights across Marketing and Product, &lt;/strong&gt;including what’s resonating, what people are asking, and where conversations are shifting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use performance and qualitative signals to improve our content strategy, &lt;/strong&gt;while building scalable systems for editorial planning, publishing, and measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who you are&lt;/h2&gt;
