&lt;li&gt;Writing clean, maintainable code to automate infrastructure management and develop the core services that power microservice architecture;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kubernetes and containerization technologies to manage large-scale server fleets and microservices;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing orchestration strategies that ensure system reliability, efficient resource allocation and seamless deployments across a distributed environment; and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing, building, and debugging high-scale distributed systems using open-source tools, analyzing complex system architectures, identifying performance bottlenecks, and implementing data-driven optimizations that improve latency, resiliency, and cost-performance ratios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary: $156,800 - $235,200/yr.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This salary range represents the base salary range for the role and any sales commissions/sales bonuses targets, if applicable, would be in addition to the base salary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;40 hrs/week&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;50% Telecommuting permitted.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Multiple Positions Available.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additional benefits for this role may include: equity, company bonus or sales commissions/bonuses; 401(k) plan; medical, dental, and vision benefits; and wellness stipends.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CA64&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
