&lt;p&gt;It’s no surprise then that solving for tax compliance is a top user ask. We launched Stripe Tax as a new SaaS product in 2021 to help solve this pain point and make tax compliance as effortless as possible. The Stripe Tax CoreXP team engineers sophisticated solutions to help our merchants grow and expand with confidence and minimal friction. The team builds solutions for monitoring tax compliance requirements, and provides solutions for registering and filing taxes.&lt;/p&gt;
