&lt;p&gt;P-301&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Candidate Experience Admin at Databricks, you&#39;ll be the engine that powers our in person recruiting efforts, focusing on physical logistics and execution to deliver a smooth, error-free onsite candidate experience. As one of the primary points of contact for candidates visiting our offices, you&#39;ll partner with Recruiters, Sourcers, and hiring teams to deliver an exceptional, high-touch interviewing experience.&lt;/p&gt;
