&lt;li&gt;In person in Seattle/Bellevue offices, 5 days a week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary onsite point of contact for candidates, managing timely, professional, and friendly communication (written and verbal) to ensure candidates feel supported throughout their journey&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships and trust with the broader Talent Acquisition team, cross-functional partners, and hiring stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
