&lt;p&gt;You will oversee the sales team, implementing sales plans, expanding existing business and delivering accurate sales forecasting and reporting.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a fantastic opportunity to build upon a highly successful team achieving significant year on year growth, in a fast growing business which is a hugely impactful part of the Canadian sales organization. We are looking for owners, who will go the extra mile and want to be the very best at what they do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
