&lt;li&gt;Experience: Proven track record in sales, ideally with Digital Natives or FSI accounts. Demonstrable experience in selling innovation, ideally in Data Platforms, AI/ML, Big Data, or Cloud technology in a consumption-first world.&lt;/li&gt;
