&lt;p&gt;Reporting to our Director of Enterprise Sales, you will manage a strategic enterprise client as part of the Retail team. &amp;nbsp;You will come with an informed point of view on Big Data, Advanced Analytics and AI which will help to guide your successful execution strategy and allow you to provide genuine value to the client.&lt;/p&gt;
