&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;22,3,0&quot;&gt;Establish strategic relationships with key C-Suite stakeholders (CIO, CDO, CTO, Head of Architecture) and cultivate internal champions across lines of business.&lt;/p&gt;
