&lt;p&gt;Reporting to our Director, Enterprise you will map to a strategic customer in the Retail vertical. &amp;nbsp;You will come with an informed point of view on Big Data, Advanced Analytics and AI which will help to guide your successful execution strategy and allow you to provide genuine value to the client&lt;/p&gt;
