&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;SLSQ427R1137&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our accelerating APJ growth, Databricks is looking for a dynamic Named Hunter Account Executive to join the founding team. This exciting new logo Sales role will make an important impact on revenue and the expansion of our business in Singapore.&lt;/p&gt;
