&lt;li&gt;Optimize system performance, reliability, and scalability through meticulous analysis and innovative solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with JVM internals, memory management, concurrency, and distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with other senior engineers and architects to define technical strategies and roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
