&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, our core values are at the heart of everything we do; a culture of proactivity and a customer-centric mindset guide us in creating a unified platform that makes Data Engineering, Data Science, Analytics &amp;amp; GenAI accessible to everyone. We aim to inspire our customers to make informed decisions that push their business forward. We provide a user-friendly and intuitive platform that makes it easy to turn insights into action and fosters a culture of creativity, experimentation, and continuous improvement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Solutions Architect, you are an expert-level technical leader responsible for the organisation&#39;s most complex customer engagements. You drive consumption strategy, own executive-level relationships, and serve as the definitive technical authority for your accounts. You have declared your archetype - a recognised technical specialisation that makes you a force multiplier across your team and region. You operate at the intersection of deep technical expertise, strategic account planning, and executive influence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will report to a Field Engineering Manager in the Emerging Enterprises team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the technical and consumption strategy in partnership with Account Executives for Startup &amp;amp; Digital Native customers in the Nordics region, directly influencing platform adoption and revenue growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will influence stakeholders at all levels through complex engagements with the broader cloud ecosystem and 3rd-party applications, ensuring they are excited by the Databricks vision and solution strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a &#39;champion’ for both customers and colleagues, operating as an expert architect and trusted advisor for significant data analytics architecture, design, and adoption of the Databricks Data Intelligence platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the most complex architecture engagements: multi-workload platforms, enterprise-wide migrations, real-time systems, and AI/ML at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to Field Engineering thought leadership through customer-facing content, workshops, and community engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach junior Solutions Architects and teams on use-case prioritisation and on building technical champions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
