&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in solutions architecture, principal engineering, technical pre-sales leadership, or a senior customer-facing technical role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong &quot;AI-Builder&quot; mindset; Expert-level coding proficiency — Python, SQL, and ideally Spark/PySpark. You will complete a live coding assessment and a platform build during the interview process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of driving consumption growth and platform adoption with customers. Experience working with and/or within Startups and Digital Native organisations will be advantageous for this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical architecture skills with deep expertise in enterprise data technologies: distributed systems at scale, streaming/real-time, lakehouse design patterns, data governance frameworks, and cloud-native platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level cloud platform knowledge (Databricks, AWS, Azure, GCP or equivalent depth in competing modern data platforms with demonstrated rapid learning ability)&lt;/li&gt;
