&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and architecting distributed data systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable programming in, and debugging, at least one of: Python, SQL, Scala, Java, or R&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with global system integrators, consulting organizations, or financial services technology, or financial services data providers is a positive differentiator&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
