&lt;li&gt;Engage with Solutions Architects to understand the full use case demand plan for prioritised customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the post-technical win technical account strategy and execution plan for the majority of Databricks use cases within our most strategic accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the accountable technical leader assigned to specific use cases and customer(s) across multiple selling teams and internal stakeholders, creating certainty from uncertainty and driving onboarding, enablement, success, go-live and healthy consumption of the workloads where the customer has made the decision to consume Databricks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the first contact for any technical issues or questions related to production/go live status of agreed upon use cases within an account, oftentimes services multiple use cases within the largest and most complex organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage both Shared Services, User Education, Onboarding/Technical Services and Support resources, along with escalating to expert level technical experts to build the right tasks that are beyond your scope of activities or expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create, own and execute a point-of-view as to how key use cases can be accelerated into production, coordinating with Professional Services (PS) resources on the delivery of PS Engagement proposals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate Databricks Product and Engineering teams for new product Innovations, private previews and upgrade needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop an execution plan that covers all activities of all customer-facing technical roles and teams to cover the below work streams:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Main use cases moving from ‘win’ to production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enablement / user growth plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product adoption (strategy and activities to increase adoption of Databricks’ Lakehouse vision)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organic needs for current investment (e.g. cloud cost control, tuning &amp;amp; optimization)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive and operational governance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide internal and external updates - KPI reporting on the status of usage and customer health, covering investment status, important risks, product adoption and use case progression - to your Technical GM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience where you have been accountable for technical project / program delivery within the domain of Data and AI and where you can contribute to technical debate and design choices with customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programming experience in Python, SQL or Scala&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a customer-facing pre-sales, technical architecture, customer success, or consulting role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of solution architecture related distributed data systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of how to attribute business value and outcomes to specific project deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical program, or project management including account, stakeholder and resource management accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience resolving complex and important escalation with senior customer executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience conducting open-ended discovery workshops,&amp;nbsp; creating strategic roadmaps, conducting business analysis and managing delivery of complex programmes/projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of overachievement against quota, Goals or similar objective targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proficiency in Mandarin and experience in the Greater China Region are required to enable effective collaboration and understanding of client needs. The successful candidate will engage with the Greater China Region customers in Mandarin for technical sales discussions, address technical challenges, and articulate clear technical solutions and value propositions.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Information Systems, Engineering, or equivalent experience through work experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can travel up to 30% when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;CSQ427R89&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The FDE (Forward Deployed Engineering) team is a new, strategic initiative sponsored by the CEO and Founders. Our mission is to win C-suite-sponsored, high-value AI opportunities by selling and delivering &lt;em&gt;outcomes&lt;/em&gt;, not just a platform. You will be part of the founding team, embedded with our most strategic customers from the very first sales call through to a production-ready solution. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will be the &quot;product manager&quot; for the customer&#39;s problem, responsible for the &quot;why&quot; and &quot;what,&quot; while our FDEs (Engineers) will be your partners responsible for the &quot;how.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Deployment Strategist (DS), you are the critical bridge between a customer&#39;s multi-million-dollar business problem and Databricks&#39; technical solution. You are a product manager for the field, owning the technical and product direction of the engagement from initial discovery through production launch and adoption.&amp;nbsp;You will build C-suite trust, perform deep discovery to map the customer&#39;s political and technical landscape, and scope the value. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will define the Minimum Viable Product for a pilot, write the PRD that guides the engineering team, and manage the project to a successful landing. You will also lead technical discovery, shape solution architecture with FDEs, and ensure that each proposed solution can move from prototype to production.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This role requires a rare combination of executive presence, deep product thinking, technical depth, and a hands-on delivery mindset.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;C-Suite Scoping &amp;amp; Value Definition:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Sales to perform deep discovery, map the customer&#39;s organization, quantify the business value of $10M+ problems, and define the pilot, including its MVP, success criteria, and timeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Product Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Author the PRD, prioritize the engineering backlog, manage scope, and act as the primary hands-on QA tester. Translate business requirements into clear data, integration, security, and operational requirements that engineers can build against.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Solution Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &amp;amp; Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive the FDE build team through an agile delivery process, manage stakeholders from the C-suite to individual engineers, and unblock technical or organizational issues. Lead technical discovery and design reviews. Understand the customer&#39;s data flows, integrations, platform constraints, and operational environment; pressure-test architecture choices; and identify technical risks early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Launch &amp;amp; Landing:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the &quot;Day 0&quot; launch, manage the war room, and drive the solution from launch to full adoption by capturing user feedback, iterating, and proving the defined business value. Own production readiness across data quality, testing, security, performance, and operations. Work with the team to diagnose issues and drive them to resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Handoff &amp;amp; Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Scope the ongoing maintenance plan, create customer documentation/training, and leverage your trusted advisor status to identify the next high-value FDE engagement. Codify reusable solution patterns and bring field insights back to Product and Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Presence &amp;amp; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; You are a trusted advisor with strong executive presence and excellent communication skills. You are confident and humble, can build rapport quickly, and can help senior stakeholders make difficult decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Judgment &amp;amp; Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; You can define what to build and why, write strong product requirements, prioritize engineering work, manage scope, and lead complex agile software projects from an ambiguous problem to a measurable outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Fluency &amp;amp; Architecture Judgment:&lt;/strong&gt; You understand modern data and AI architectures, including cloud platforms, data pipelines, data models, distributed systems, APIs, security and governance, machine learning, and generative AI application patterns. You can lead architecture discussions, evaluate trade-offs, and pressure-test technical decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on Technical Ability:&lt;/strong&gt; You are proficient in at least one language, such as Python, Java, or SQL. You can explore data, work in notebooks, read and review code and pipelines, build or adapt prototypes, and contribute meaningfully to troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relevant Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Typically 7+ years of experience delivering complex, customer-facing data, analytics, AI, or software engagements, or equivalent experience as a founder or technical builder. You have helped deliver data, machine learning, or generative AI systems into production and understand the integration, operational, and adoption challenges that appear in real environments. Experience in a high-growth technology company, forward-deployed organization, or leading consultancy is valuable. You enjoy working onsite with customers (often 25-50%, sometimes higher) to drive delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
