&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Drive Commercial Structuring &amp;amp; Co-Funding Models: Formulate innovative commercial deal structures and unlock co-investment/funding vehicles across Databricks, CSPs (AWS, Azure, GCP), and strategic partners to solve customer budget constraints&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
