&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;10+ years experience in data engineering, data platforms &amp;amp; analytics, or software engineering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
