&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Expertise in MLOps, ML/AI models, and AI APIs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
