&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Experience&lt;/strong&gt;: 10+ years of relevant experience, with extensive expertise in business partnering, influencing cross-functional stakeholders, and consumption-based revenue recognition/accounting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Acumen&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience writing SQL and past experience using Databricks strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
