&lt;h2&gt;Mission&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we’re on a mission to help data teams solve the world’s toughest problems. The Databricks Free Edition makes it easy for students, enthusiasts, and aspiring professionals to explore data and AI hands-on, gaining the skills and confidence to build the future.&lt;/p&gt;
