&lt;li&gt;Define and build new platform services that enable Databricks’ data &amp;amp; AI product teams (ML/AI, Data Science &amp;amp; Engineering, Data Warehousing, etc.) to easily add new workload-specific governance capabilities that enhance the value of Unity Catalog and the Lakehouse.&lt;/li&gt;
