&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9233&quot;&gt;Know how to engage in complex customer interactions and sales lifecycle in a technical pre-sales capacity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9343&quot;&gt;Ability to influence decision-makers and C-level executives by developing relationships and orchestrating teams to achieve long-term customer success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9497&quot;&gt;Prior experience with coding in a core programming language (i.e., Python, Java, Scala) and willingness to learn a base level of Spark.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
