&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in People Tech, HR tech, or internal tooling domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Workday, Greenhouse or similar enterprise HR platforms — especially via API or integration layer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience evaluating and red-teaming LLM agents for safety, reliability, and correctness in sensitive business contexts.&lt;/li&gt;
