&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,3,0&quot;&gt;A modern, tech-forward mindset: genuinely curious about the business, hands-on with new AI and productivity tools, and able to speak credibly to specialized corporate and operational candidates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
