&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,4,0&quot;&gt;Comfort with ambiguity and scale — you stay calm, prioritize ruthlessly, and thrive when the goalposts move and the pressure is on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,5,0&quot;&gt;The ability to build strategic partnerships across the business and influence senior corporate executives with data and conviction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,6,0&quot;&gt;A creative, resourceful approach to sourcing — you don&#39;t rely on the obvious channels and you love finding top-tier corporate talent others can&#39;t.&lt;/p&gt;
