&lt;p&gt;As a Strategic Account Executive, Public Sector, you will own strategic sales into a marquee customer in Canada&#39;s public sector, driving adoption of our data and AI platform. You will lead the full sales cycle, build executive relationships, and collaborate closely with internal and partner teams to support Canada&#39;s digital government and modernization initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
