&lt;li&gt;7+ years of SaaS, cloud, AI, or big data sales experience in Public Sector, with meaningful exposure to public sector accounts and a proven ability to drive adoption of new technologies through a consultative, solutions‑oriented sales approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must speak fluent French&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to navigate complex public sector stakeholder ecosystems, building consensus across multiple departments, budget owners, and decision/approval layers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of public sector priorities in Canada, including typical buying processes, buying cycles, decision‑making structures, and the broader ecosystem of partners that support government projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience with Canadian government procurement, including familiarity with budget formulation and execution, tender/RFP processes, evaluation criteria, and relevant compliance and security frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background in selling usage‑based PaaS/SaaS or data, AI, and ML solutions is highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience applying structured sales methodologies and processes (e.g., account planning, MEDDPICC, value selling, Command of the Message) to win complex, multi‑stakeholder deals.&lt;/li&gt;
