&lt;p&gt;Do you want to help solve the world&#39;s toughest problems with big data and AI? This is what we do every day at Databricks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Strategic Account Executive, you will be responsible for driving the strategic relationship between Databricks and one of our key cusotmers in the Nordic region,&amp;nbsp;ensuring the successful adoption and expansion of Databricks solutions. You will work closely with the customer&#39;s&amp;nbsp;key stakeholders to understand their business needs and challenges and leverage Databricks&#39; technology to deliver impactful solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
