&lt;li&gt;Identify and pursue new business opportunities, expanding the footprint of Databricks solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Databricks&#39; internal teams, including sales, solutions engineering, and customer success, and external ecosystem partners to ensure seamless delivery and support for the customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary point of contact,&amp;nbsp;addressing any issues or concerns and ensuring high levels of customer satisfaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay informed about&amp;nbsp;industry trends, challenges, and opportunities, and provide insights to help shape Databricks&#39; product and service offerings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive revenue growth by meeting or exceeding sales targets and KPIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
