&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1648&quot;&gt;While candidates in the listed location(s) are encouraged for this role, candidates in other locations will be considered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Strategic Account Executive at Databricks, you are a sales professional experienced in leading go-to-market campaigns within a set of Federal System Integrators (FSI). You know how to sell innovation and change through customer vision expansion and can guide deals forward to compress decision cycles. You love understanding a product in depth and are passionate about communicating value to Customers and System Integrators.&lt;/p&gt;
