&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;SLSQ328R142&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Strategic Enterprise Account Executive, your mission will be to grow one of our focus customers in Databricks PubSec team. You know how to sell within the healthcare domain and can guide deals forward to compress decision cycles. You love understanding a product in-depth and are passionate about communicating its value to customers and partners. Always prospecting for new opportunities, you will close new accounts while growing our business in existing accounts. You will report to the Strategic Enterprise Director in Singapore.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/p&gt;
