&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2386&quot;&gt;You have previously excelled in an early-stage company -- you know how to navigate and be successful with limited oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2386&quot;&gt;Previous field sales experience within big data, Cloud, SaaS, and a consumption selling motion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2386&quot;&gt;Prior customer relationships with CIOs, program managers, and essential decision makers at local accounts&lt;/li&gt;
