&lt;p&gt;Reporting to our Director of Strategic Life Sciences Sales, you will be assigned to one strategic client within the Life Sciences team (Med Device). &amp;nbsp;You will come with an informed point of view on Big Data, Advanced Analytics, and AI, which will help to guide your successful execution strategy and allow you to provide genuine value to the client&lt;/p&gt;
