&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In this role, your primary responsibility is driving business growth and expanding the customer base of Cloudflare by identifying and nurturing potential opportunities through proactive outreach and effective lead qualification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospect and research potential leads or target accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiate outbound calls to introduce Cloudflare products/services&lt;/li&gt;
