&lt;li&gt;Meeting or exceeding assigned sales targets and KPIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keeping CRM data accurate and up-to-date at all times&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receiving positive feedback from team members or manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
