&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0&quot;&gt;Utilize data-informed insights to guide strategy, test hypotheses, and adapt approach as market dynamics evolve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
