&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This role is eligible to participate in Cloudflare’s equity plan.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Cloudflare offers a complete package of benefits and programs to support you and your family.&amp;nbsp; Our benefits programs can help you pay health care expenses, support caregiving, build capital for the future and make life a little easier and fun!&amp;nbsp; The below is a description of our benefits for employees in the United States, and benefits may vary for employees based outside the U.S.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
