&lt;p&gt;Want to work with emerging and established AI leaders like Anthropic and OpenAI on Cloudflare&#39;s most cutting edge AI Developer platform offering?&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-epip=&quot;&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation Range For Enterprise AI CE &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-epip=&quot;&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot;&gt;$213,500 – $335,500&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Hybrid — San Francisco/Bay Area. We are only considering candidates working currently in the Bay Area OR are intent on moving to the Bay Area&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Cloudflare, we are on a mission to help build a better Internet. Today the company runs one of the world’s largest networks that powers millions of websites and other Internet properties for customers ranging from individual bloggers to SMBs to Fortune 500 companies. Cloudflare protects and accelerates any Internet application online without adding hardware, installing software, or changing a line of code. Internet properties powered by Cloudflare all have web traffic routed through its intelligent global network, which gets smarter with every request. As a result, they see significant improvement in performance and a decrease in spam and other attacks. Cloudflare was named to Entrepreneur Magazine’s Top Company Cultures list and ranked among the World’s Most Innovative Companies by Fast Company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re not looking for people who wait for a polished roadmap. We&#39;re looking for builders — people who spot the &quot;normalized&quot; problem everyone else has learned to live with and have the curiosity and drive to fix it. Our culture is built on iteration, leveraging AI to move faster and sharing every improvement across the team. If you value curiosity over bureaucracy and see AI as a partner in solving hard problems, you&#39;ll fit right in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role &amp;amp; the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customer Engineers on the Digital Native Enterprise team work with Cloudflare&#39;s most innovative and high-growth accounts — Cloud-native, technologically advanced companies building at internet scale. This role focuses on both the acquisition of new Digital Native accounts and the expansion of existing ones. The ideal candidate is a builder with a deep technical foundation and a commercial mindset, capable of engaging from the engineer in the weeds to the executive in the boardroom — across Application Development, Performance, Security, and Infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Customer Engineer, you are a technologist embedded within the GTM organization. You own the technical relationship from initial discovery through onboarding, adoption, renewal, and expansion. You&#39;ll be delivering architectural value and measurable business outcomes across the entire customer lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to the Regional Customer Engineering Leader and partner closely with your aligned Account Executives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technical Validation (Pre-Sales)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical discovery, design bespoke architectures, and deliver compelling demos and Proofs of Concept (PoCs) across Cloudflare&#39;s portfolio — Security, Networking, and Developer Platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build technical champions and executive relationships within target accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Cloudflare at industry events, developer communities, and cybersecurity conferences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customer Adoption &amp;amp; Value Realization&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary technical contact from contract signature through full platform adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and oversee technical onboarding and implementation — you are the engineering relationship, not a handoff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively monitor customer health telemetry, resolve integration bottlenecks, and ensure rapid time-to-value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commercial Accountability &amp;amp; Expansion&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry a variable quota tied directly to new business acquisition and ongoing account growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and drive strategic cross-sell and upsell opportunities grounded in platform usage data and customer business objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical Quarterly Business Reviews (QBRs) that translate platform metrics into C-level ROI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Trusted Advisory&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain continuous, deep relationships with key stakeholders — from engineering leads to CISOs and CTOs — throughout the entire customer lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on architecture best practices, security posture, and Cloudflare platform strategy aligned to customer business goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Required&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding on The Life of a Request on the Internet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a customer-facing technical role: Solutions Engineering, Customer Engineering, Sales Engineering, or Forward Deployed Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Broad technical expertise across: web security (WAF, DDoS mitigation, TLS, Zero Trust / SASE), networking (BGP, DNS, SD-WAN, MPLS, TCP/IP), and cloud infrastructure (AWS, GCP, Azure)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and presentation skills — equally fluent in a whiteboard architecture session with engineers and a strategic business review with the C-suite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-Native Development: You have integrated AI-augmented workflows (e.g., Windsurf, OpenCode) into your daily development cycle to accelerate prototyping and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Cloudflare&#39;s Developer and AI platform: Workers, Workers AI, AI Gateway, Vectorize&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Applied AI knowledge: prompt engineering, LLM orchestration, Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Python, JavaScript, or Go — able to write integration scripts, API connectors, and edge computing functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CDN, reverse proxy (WAF), forward proxy (SWG), and serverless application patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building cloud-based applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building relationships and driving technical wins across multi-stakeholder, enterprise accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloudflare platform certifications or meaningful hands-on deployment experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to DevOps, security operations, or emerging GenAI trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant industry certifications (cloud, security, networking)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
