&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,3,0&quot;&gt;For California based hires (Except San Francisco): Estimated annual salary of $214,000 - $305,000.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
