&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_302771f7801a0067-27&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;1,0,0&quot;&gt;For Sweden based hires: Estimated annual salary is between SEK 1,109,000 - SEK 1,742,&lt;span class=&quot;citation-39 citation-end-39&quot;&gt;000.&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
