&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;For Bay Area based hires: Estimated annual salary of $284,000 - $360,000.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For New York City, Washington, Washington D.C. and California (excluding Bay Area) based hires: Estimated annual salary of $269,000-$350,000&lt;/li&gt;
