&lt;p&gt;Compensation may be adjusted depending on work location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Estimated annual salary of $360,000- $400,000 (base/variable)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
