&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For Denver based hires: Estimated annual salary of 168,000 - 231,000 USD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For Seattle based hires: Estimated annual salary of 185,000 - 254,000 USD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For Washington DC based hires: Estimated annual salary of 185,000 - 254,000 USD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For Toronto based hires: Estimated annual salary of 150,000 - 206,000 CAD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For Lisbon based hires: Estimated annual salary is between 66,000 - 91,000 EUR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
